sentences.l:
But it is also time
to sleep, either having gone to the swift ship, to my companions,
or here;

and let the stranger endure, much though of homecoming in need,
nevertheless then to remain till tomorrow, until the whole
gift I complete;

“Alcinous, lord, most conspicuous of all the people,
if even for a year you were to bid me remain right here,
and urge on my escort and give splendid gifts,

sentences.t:
ἦέ σ’ ἀνάρσιοι ἄνδρες ἐδηλήσαντ’ ἐπὶ χέρσου
βοῦς περιταμνόμενον ἠδ’ οἰῶν πώεα καλά,
ἠὲ περὶ πτόλιος μαχεούμενον ἠδὲ γυναικῶν;

sentences.l:
Truly, I said at least,
welcome to my children and to my servants
home that I would come;

but she, outstandingly grievous things knowing,
for herself shame poured down, and for those yet to be, hereafter,
female women, even for whichever may be well-working.
